-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a74.7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ni disque, ni stockage navigateur, ni serveur."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_tableau_reglages", "label": "Tableau des r\u00e9glages (valeurs de d\u00e9part, \u00c0 confirmer P0/P1/P2)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_calibrage_neutre", "label": "Calibrage du neutre n (m\u00e9diane de S, 3 s)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_calibrage_sourire", "label": "Calibrage du sourire volontaire v (maximum de S, 2 s)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Viser haut : sous-estimer v co\u00fbte environ 20 fois plus de faux positifs que le surestimer."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_r1_calibrage", "label": "R1 \u2014 Calibrage", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rendre \u00ab qualit\u00e9 insuffisante \u00bb mesurable et emp\u00eacher un neutre truqu\u00e9."}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_r2_detection_sourire", "label": "R2 \u2014 D\u00e9tection du sourire", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/D2-regles-jeu-arbitrage.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_d2_regles_jeu_arbitrage_maintien_500ms", "label":